WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.920
In 2009, Swiss voters banned
the building of new minarets.

2
00:00:04.970 --> 00:00:08.690
A year later, France banned
face coverings in public.

3
00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:15.610
Back in 1997, a British report had made
one word widely known: Islamophobia.

4
00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:18.520
Can a Muslim live
faithfully as a minority?

5
00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:21.990
And why do so many Europeans fear Islam?

6
00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:26.400
In this mission, you'll trace the events
and laws that put Muslims in Europe in

7
00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:27.520
the spotlight.

8
00:00:27.570 --> 00:00:30.880
Then you'll sort open views
of Islam from closed ones,

9
00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:34.420
and test how far the media
shapes what people think.

10
00:00:34.470 --> 00:00:38.920
Your mission: weigh up whether a Muslim
can live faithfully as a minority,

11
00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:41.330
and why fear of Islam spreads.
